    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSet within the well regarded Castlemill development, No. 53 presents an exceptional opportunity to acquire a spacious first-floor, two-bedroom apartment in a prime Balbriggan location. This modern residence has been thoughtfully designed with both comfort and practicality in mind, offering well-proportioned accommodation ideal for a range of buyers. Upon entering, one is welcomed into a bright and contemporary open-plan kitchen and living area, where clean lines and generous proportions create an inviting space for both relaxation and entertaining. The modern kitchen is fitted with ample storage and seamlessly integrates with the living area, while doors open onto a charming false balcony, allowing natural light to flood the space.\nThe apartment comprises two large double bedrooms, both offering excellent storage potential. The principal bedroom benefits from a private ensuite, finished to a high standard, while the second bedroom is equally spacious and well-appointed. A large family bathroom, complete with a shower over bath, serves the remainder of the accommodation. Residents of No. 53 enjoy the convenience of secure underground parking with lift access directly to the block, alongside additional communal parking located to the front and side. The property further benefits from electric storage heating and double-glazed windows, ensuring comfort and efficiency throughout the year.\nSituated within the ever-popular Castlemill development, the property is just moments from a thriving shopping centre anchored by Dunnes Stores, as well as a host of local amenities. Its proximity to Balbriggan town enhances its appeal, offering easy access to transport links, schools, and coastal attractions.\nCombining modern living with a superb location, No. 53 Castlemill represents a wonderful opportunity to secure a home in one of Balbriggan's most sought-after developments."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - \nwith laminate wood flooring and hot-press storage.\n\nLiving area - \nwith laminate wood flooring, TV points, spacious living area, french door access to false balcony\n\nKitchen - \nwith tiled floor flooring, good range of built-in kitchen units and worktops, tiled splashback, plumbed for washing machine and dishwasher.\n\nBedroom One - \nwith laminate flooring, double bedroom with built in wardrobes and TV point, door to ensuite with wc, whb and shower unit.\n\nBedroom Two - \nlaminate wood flooring, double bedroom with built in wardrobes.\n\nBathroom - \nwith w.c, w.h.b., bath with shower above, fully tiled throughout\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>First floor 2 Bed 2 bath, apartment</li><li>2 large double bedrooms with main bedroom ensuite</li><li>Secure underground parking with lift access to the block</li><li>Open plan kitchen / living area with doors to false balcony</li><li>Modern kitchen with ample storage</li><li>Additional communal parking to the side and front of the block</li><li>Electric Storage heating and Double-glazed windows</li><li>Large family bathroom with shower over bath</li><li>Within the Castlemill development with Dunnestores as anchor tenants in the shopping centre</li><li>Much Sought After Modern Development close to Balbriggan town</ul>"
      },
      {
